### 1. UNAUTHENTICATED access to /admin
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/admin

###

### 2. USER tries to access /admin (403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/admin
Authorization: Basic user user

###

### 3. ADMIN accesses /admin (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

### 4. SUPERADMIN accesses /admin (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/admin
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###

### 5. UNAUTHENTICATED access to /user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/user

###

### 6. USER accesses /user (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/user
Authorization: Basic user user

###

### 7. ADMIN access /user (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

### 8. SUPERADMIN access /user (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/user
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin

###

### 9. UNAUTHENTICATED access to /unauthenticated (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/unauthenticated

###

### 10. USER accesses /unauthenticated (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/unauthenticated
Authorization: Basic user user
